  m_Text: 'TRUXTON REMASTER   /   F1 TO CLOSE


    WASD / ARROWS   Move     SHIFT  
    Precision

    SPACE / Z / LEFT MOUSE   Fire

    X / RIGHT MOUSE / SKULL ICONS  
    Bomb

    C   Use change charge     P / ESC   Pause

    HOME   Restart

    F3  
    Jump to the round-end boss encounter


    P upgrades shots. B upgrades bomb
    strength.

    Skulls add bombs. C adds change charges.

    Colored pickups
    select a weapon. Extra lives restore ships.

    The ship counter shows your
    remaining reserves.'
